{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "593c5920ac4344c226543120a5449c7012fe0b2ac0b38d8fea93c7d874f61e91", "ja": "（ドラマ撮影の昼休憩が、もうすぐ終わる。\nひなたも、そろそろ戻ってくる頃かな）", "zh": "（电视剧拍摄的午休时间快结束了。日向差不多也该回来了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "58fe81a685be9a7d579e6c76f0776231e19574a52b18b850792ff97ff6b458b4", "ja": "{$P$}、お昼いただいたよぉ。\n午後の撮影も、がんばるべさ。えへへ。", "zh": "{$P$}，我吃过午饭啦。下午的拍摄也要好好加油哩。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7cd489b3967b6c18104897c1b7a5c295528cc1f1c1196d6a327db78ed6c1afdd", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。\nずいぶん嬉しそうだけど、何か良い事でもあったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，日向。\n看起来特别开心，是遇到什么好事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "3641c9082a2fad95bab466e957f44e68440c7f16b22f7fe7378fb6d1c518eec0", "ja": "えへへ、わかるかい？　今日のお弁当ね、\nみんなと外のベンチで食べてきたんだけども……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，看得出来吗？今天的便当啊，我和大家一起在外面的长椅上吃了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "24e528dc201bd29c3a719c4c5de9910953832251c4713affe005e02ac8873370", "ja": "それが、なまら楽しかったんだべさ。\nみんなとおかずとか交換っこしたりして。", "zh": "别提多开心了。\n还和大家互相交换菜肴来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c0bbec31e249ef0d68151ccf801c357168ce11ea73abde88ac3e50638c0a6184", "ja": "はは、それは確かに楽しそうだ。\n話だけ聞くと、ピクニックみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，听起来确实很开心。\n光听你说，就像是在野餐一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "172e166a4b62a1e654e3434125472836724c47f099bafe1cf8e417f7ac6f398c", "ja": "うん、そうなんだぁ。だけどあたし、\nちょっこし気になったことがあって……。", "zh": "嗯，确实是呢。不过我啊，\n稍微有点好奇的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "243dbc289a7632f9b076c9af02a67899a7542890ee11a813d7ab5337f8f75163", "ja": "ピクニックもそうだけど、なしてお弁当って、\nお外で食べるとあんなにおいしいんだろうねえ？", "zh": "野餐也是，不过为什么便当在外面吃，就会那么好吃呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1008_p", "source_sha256": "22a5cf1f1bfdcb2bee8de4948020aac5ceb956f912513433d486ac23ca9368a1", "ja": "そうだな……外で食べると、\n気分が変わるっていうのもあると思うけど……。", "zh": "是啊……在外面吃饭，或许也是因为心情会有所变化吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8fe72219cfc1737c31550f2deda947ba03598fb9f4be57b61efd0c8e07f9e877", "ja": "みんなと一緒だから、\nそれで余計に美味しいのかもしれないな。", "zh": "因为是和大家在一起，\n所以才觉得格外好吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "3bc16fdc60becddac07ea10cb722b8a332538f81166a445d6d8442600d6cce3f", "ja": "みんなと、一緒だから……ああ、そうだねえ。\nそうかもしれないよぉ。", "zh": "因为和大家在一起……啊，是呢。\n或许真的是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "13bfbc1a4a5105df94d320e3e0cb8d8426fffcbee2db27db60b773ac3245c15d", "ja": "午前中の撮影で、おばあちゃんに席を譲るシーンが\nあったけども。あの時も、おんなしだったねぇ。", "zh": "上午拍摄时，有一场给老奶奶让座的戏。那时候也是一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "284630cedfc91c577ac95cccd44fff0aa3b9dd09090cfc9cd7623a645fc73151", "ja": "おばあちゃんが、うれしそうに笑ってくれたもんで、\nあたしもつられて笑ってしまったんだべさ。", "zh": "奶奶开心地笑了起来，我也不由得跟着笑了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ce422e07da405d14f4c046a9e1fe10a7129c6ac53a13050d3b20b6a0a0e49a07", "ja": "うん。すごく、自然な笑顔だったと思う。\nそれと同じで……。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得那是十分自然的笑容。\n正如那件事一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ad4b30194ebd42f476434000b794f0fc6ae86ebf03cc824fbff6c50d0e1c3f1f", "ja": "みんなが「美味しい」って言う、その笑顔につられて、\nひなたも美味しいと感じてるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "或许正是被大家说“好吃”时的笑容所感染，\n日向才会也觉得很好吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "98be179c144f48cb15638392d73c0fff0377339afbd4d8ebd3ff6fb27c0fa32d", "ja": "そっかぁ。あたしとみんなと、おかずを交換っこした\nだけじゃなくて、笑顔も交換っこしてたんだねぇ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。我们不只是和大家交换了菜，还交换了笑容呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2f015c97c96238408398582256bd8a4bbd2c40ad9659ecb6ee7c37ec377517b2", "ja": "笑顔の交換っこか……うん、いいな。\nひなたらしい、あたたかい表現だと思うよ。", "zh": "交换笑容吗……嗯，不错。我觉得这是很有日向风格的温暖表达。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "b2b33c0b838f1dc6fd553c1631266bc67e27ff3d2c9498960fcb53b9144810c6", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとねぇ。\nあたし、なんだか、ほっこりしたよぉ。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你呀。\n我呀，不知怎么的，心里暖暖的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1018_p", "source_sha256": "56320ca29d06a9bb8b531063def911023fb40178986a2044c0ec60ae13edfa4e", "ja": "よし。じゃあそのあったかい気持ちのまま、\n午後の撮影も乗り切ろうな！", "zh": "好。那就保持这份温暖的心情，努力完成下午的拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0163_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "65b2a86e6a70e4c2d79ce32977c930164fc7d32d080352b026db831465d47647", "ja": "うん！　撮影でも、みんなと\n笑顔を交換っこできるように、がんばるべさ。", "zh": "嗯！我也会加油的，希望在拍摄时也能和大家交换笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
